  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-08T09:34:30.497Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the Index Controllers you can have your gestures turned off and your Fingers can move but your Gesture Expressions are disabled. \nBut as soon as you do that with other Controllers for example the Oculus Touch controllers your fingers just lock in place. \nWhy not have an option where you can still move your fingers but not have it drive any Gesture Expressions. I think it would be a great addition.",
